sheet.description:
1: Sticky Webs — Thick webs make area Difficult Terrain; enemies starting turn must succeed on Strength save or be Restrained (Athletics check to escape).;
2: Caustic Ooze — Ground is Difficult Terrain; enemies starting turn take 1d6 Acid and must make Dex save or be Prone (scales at levels 11/16).;
3: Terrifying Screams — Enemies starting turn take 1d6 Psychic and Wisdom save or be Frightened (scales at levels 11/16).;
4: Enthralling Spores — Area Heavily Obscured for chosen creatures; enemies starting turn must make Wisdom save or be Charmed (scales at level 11).;
5: Poisonous Foliage — Area Lightly Obscured; enemies starting turn take 1d6 Poison and Con save or be Poisoned (scales at 11/16).;
6: Enervating Bones — Spectral limbs deal 1d10 Necrotic and prevent HP regain until start of next turn (scales at 11/16).
